| `samples` | 3 | 1 to 16; every sample of a reading must agree |
| `sample_interval_us` | 1000 | 0 to 100000 |

| Preset | What it sets |
| --- | --- |
| `FastPreset()` | One read per reading, no filtering |
| `DebouncedPreset()` | 8 reads, 5 ms apart |

